Subject: [PATCH 3/8] dodge: Clamp 8K video to 30fps to fix freeze after using
 4K120

Enabling real-time 1080p/4K 120fps adds 120 to the rear_main video fps
allow-list in camera_unit_feature_config.protobuf. That list is per-camera
and has no per-resolution scoping, so once 120fps is selected at 4K the
---
